<title>AUSTRALIA: Australia 1996/97 trade surplus A$2.818 billion.</title>
<headline>Australia 1996/97 trade surplus A$2.818 billion.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia's balance of trade on goods and services recorded a surplus of A$2.818 billion over the 1996/97 fiscal year to June 30, the Australian Bureau of Statistics reported on Tuesday.</p>
<p>This compared with a deficit of A$766 million a year earlier.</p>
<p>The bureau said exports of goods and services rose six percent while imports rose three percent over 1996/97.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
